---
description: Aegis global project invariants
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read AGENTS.md before making non-trivial changes.
- Never fake an external action.
- Never bypass the permission engine.
- Never allow LLM output to mutate authoritative state directly.
- Never invent facts, evidence, policy, amounts, provider responses, IDs, dates or outcomes.
- Preserve provenance.
- Use deterministic logic for money, permissions, authorization, state transitions, validation and verification.
- Consequential actions must be auditable and idempotent.
- Do not silently swallow errors.
